For task A the code should be run as such:
make clean
make 
./main A

For task B the code should be run in the same way:
make clean 
make
./main B

For problem C you should run it as 
make clean
make
make out.times.data
gnuplot times.gpi

The files Problem_A.txt and Problem_B.txt are the results of running ./main A and ./main B respectively. 

plot_C.svg is the result of task C. It is the runtime as function of N

AI was used for the code. 


